                    "def neighbors_of(graph, node):\n    pass\n\ngraph = {'A': ['B', 'C'], 'B': ['A'], 'C': ['A']}\nprint(neighbors_of(graph, 'A'))\nprint(neighbors_of(graph, 'Z'))",
