                    {"en": "Track low and high bounds, check the midpoint each time.", "fr": "Suivez les bornes low et high, vérifiez le milieu à chaque fois.", "ar": "تتبع حدود low وhigh، وافحص المنتصف كل مرة."},
                    {"en": "This is the O(log n) algorithm behind fast dictionary and phone-book-style lookups.", "fr": "C'est l'algorithme O(log n) derrière les recherches rapides façon dictionnaire.", "ar": "هذه هي خوارزمية O(log n) وراء عمليات البحث السريعة بأسلوب القاموس."},
                    "def binary_search(sorted_list, target):\n    pass\n\nprint(binary_search([1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11], 7))\nprint(binary_search([1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11], 4))",
